DESCRIPTION:On Oct 14 the City Council asked staff to bring back options on
  the Critical Areas Ordinance (proposed 100-ft creek buffer) by the end of
  November. The City's Critical Areas page (read Oct 30) says this is expec
 ted at this meeting. Check the agenda when it posts: https://agendas.ci.wa
